aviour of `@export_dir` annotation.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon(TM) R4 Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 27.20.20912.1002) - AMD A6-9225 RADEON R4, 5 COMPUTE CORES 2C+3G (2 threads) - 11.44 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt isn't possible to drag and drop folders into an exposed variable using the @export_dir annotation. But it does accept files.\n\n<img width=\"212\" height=\"169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c735ec8e-bf07-44df-a6bf-4c0345989804\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAny new project, just create a script and then expose a property with `@export_dir` annotation. Drag a folder then a file, it should reject the folder and accept the file.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118646/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1}